SUMMARY:Common Threads\, What Unites Us
DESCRIPTION:Common Threads\, What Unites Us is a collaboration between Lucy Boland of Bluewater Silk and Louise McGowan Bezark of Journey Vessels. The result is Lucy’s collection of reimagined vintage Japanese textiles and Louise’s fine art gourds. Lucy focus is on history and repurposing\, and Louise emphasizes nature and transformation. This show celebrates craftsmanship\, East Asian influence\, tradition\, and human connection.
