SUMMARY:Make Your Own Leather Bracers!
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for Halloween or Renfair by making your own bracers! In this two-day beginner workshop\, you’ll learn the leather making process\, from cutting and shaping the leather to setting hardware\, stamping\, and dyeing. Wow your friends and elevate your costumes with your own custom bracers!\nNo prior experience needed. Beginners are welcome!\nChildren under 13 must be accompanied by an adult\nAll materials included\nInstructor: Percy (He/They)\nALL AGES\nPrice: $70\nTime: 10:00 am-12:00 pm\nWorkshop date:\nSaturdays\, September 12 & 19
