SUMMARY:Griefball weekend camp x Sacramento Kings
DESCRIPTION:Griefball Uses Basketball to Address Grief and Mental Health Among Teen Boys\nThe Center for Loss & Hope at YoloCares is launching Griefball\, an innovative two-day weekend camp that combines basketball with somatic grief practices to help boys and young men\, ages 7-25\, who have experienced the death of a loved one. \nHosted in collaboration with the Sacramento Kings\, Griefball brings together Jr. Kings coaches\, grief specialists\, and trained volunteers to address the growing mental health challenges facing boys and young men.
