SUMMARY:Dive Into Downtown
DESCRIPTION:New Aggies are coming to Davis — and we’re ready to welcome them downtown! 🐴 \n📅 September 16\, 18 & 19\, 2026 \nDive Into Downtown is back to introduce incoming UC Davis students to everything Downtown Davis has to offer — from favorite places to eat and shop to the businesses and experiences that make our downtown community special. \n🐴 NEW AGGIES: Get ready to explore your new downtown\, discover local favorites and start finding the places that will feel like home during your time at UC Davis! \n🏪 DOWNTOWN BUSINESSES: Get ready to welcome an influx of new Aggies into downtown! This is a great opportunity to introduce your business to thousands of new students as they begin exploring Davis. \nBusinesses can also get involved by signing up to offer an Aggie Deal or Aggie Super Deal during the event. More information and sign-up details are coming soon!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/dive-into-downtown/2026-09-19/
